<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="667921833"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:25.253"><div begin="15.246" end="28.967" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="15.246" end="19.013" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="15.246" end="15.734">若这</span><span begin="15.734" end="17.570">一束吊灯</span><span begin="17.570" end="18.408">倾泻下</span><span begin="18.408" end="19.013">来</span></p><p begin="19.158" end="22.246" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.158" end="19.630">或者</span><span begin="19.630" end="20.261">我</span><span begin="20.337" end="21.474">已不会存</span><span begin="21.474" end="22.246">在</span></p><p begin="22.510" end="24.838" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.510" end="23.471">即使你不</span><span begin="23.471" end="24.838">爱</span></p><p begin="26.149" end="28.967" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.149" end="27.281">亦不需要分</span><span begin="27.281" end="28.967">开</span></p></div><div begin="30.647" end="44.854" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="30.647" end="34.522" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.647" end="31.120">若这</span><span begin="31.120" end="33.043">一刻我竟</span><span begin="33.043" end="33.881">严重痴</span><span begin="33.881" end="34.522">呆</span></p><p begin="34.786" end="37.531" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.786" end="35.032">根</span><span begin="35.032" end="35.876">本不</span><span begin="35.876" end="36.749">需要被</span><span begin="36.749" end="37.531">爱</span></p><p begin="37.697" end="40.324" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.697" end="39.184">永远在床上发</span><span begin="39.184" end="40.324">梦</span></p><p begin="41.661" end="44.854" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.661" end="42.776">余生都不会</span><span begin="42.776" end="43.318">再</span><span begin="43.318" end="43.639">悲</span><span begin="43.639" end="44.854">哀</span></p></div><div begin="47.343" end="1:00.494" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.343" end="50.495" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begi